# Mechanical Mobster: "exile up to one target card" is optional, and "target creature you control connives" still happens with both graveyards empty. Bot1 casts three Moxen and the
# Mobster on turn 1; the only target is the Mobster itself. It connives: Bot1 draws Grizzly Bears and discards it, a nonland card, so the Mobster gets a +1/+1 counter (3/2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mechanical Mobster
Forest
Mountain
Plains
Grizzly Bears
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mechanical Mobster.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Mechanical Mobster)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Battlefield.Mechanical Mobster.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Mechanical Mobster.Toughness = 2
